<title>USA: AMEX to list options on GST Telecommunications.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list options on GST Telecommunications.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said on Wednesday that it would list options on GST Telecommunications Inc on November 5.</p>
<p>The exchange said GST options would have initial expiration months of November, December, March and June. Opening strike prices will be 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2. The stock closed at 9-7/8 Wednesday, unchanged.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will be the specialist for the options, the AMEX said.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
